{"seq":1,"slug":"mao-zedong-thought","title":"毛泽东思想核心理论","stage":"DONE","category":"mao-zedong-studies","categoryLabel":"毛泽东研究","chapterCount":4,"docCount":10,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought","rating":{"composite":3.89,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/01_mao-zedong-studies/01_mao-zedong-thought","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"毛泽东思想核心理论-简介\">毛泽东思想核心理论 简介</h1><h2 id=\"本库定位\">本库定位</h2><p>毛泽东思想是马克思列宁主义基本原理与中国革命具体实践相结合的产物，系统回答了在半殖民地半封建社会条件下如何革命、如何建设、如何建党的根本问题。本库是这个主题下的<strong>体系总纲</strong>：不按著作年代逐篇讲文本，而按理论专题回答四个问题——这套思想<strong>从哪里来</strong>（第一章：形成史、活的灵魂、中国化命题）、<strong>包含哪些核心内容</strong>（第二章：革命与军事；第三章：党建与建设探索）、<strong>如何定位其历史价值</strong>（第四章：第一次飞跃与当代意义）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟库的分工边界\">与兄弟库的分工边界</h2><p>mao-zedong-studies 合集下共有 19 个库。本库负责&quot;体系骨架&quot;，兄弟库负责&quot;文本细读&quot;与&quot;专题纵深&quot;。选库前先看这张表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>库</th>\n<th>讲什么</th>\n<th>与本库的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../selected-works-of-mao/\">毛泽东选集（四卷）</a></td>\n<td>按四卷编排的原著导读</td>\n<td>本库按理论专题组织，不按著作年代；查某篇原文的写作背景去该库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../on-contradiction/\">《矛盾论》精读</a></td>\n<td>《矛盾论》文本逐段解读</td>\n<td>本库只在哲学贡献层面概述&quot;两论&quot;地位，论证细节在该库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../on-practice/\">《实践论》精读</a></td>\n<td>《实践论》文本逐段解读</td>\n<td>同上——本库讲认识论在体系中的位置，不替代文本细读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../on-protracted-war/\">《论持久战》精读</a></td>\n<td>持久战的论证结构与文本分析</td>\n<td>本库军事章给出三阶段结论及其在体系中的位置；推理过程在该库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../on-new-democracy/\">《新民主主义论》精读</a></td>\n<td>该篇原著的纲领展开</td>\n<td>本库第二章给出理论框架；三大纲领的原文层次在该库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../mao-poetry/\">毛泽东诗词研究</a></td>\n<td>诗词文本与创作背景</td>\n<td>与本库理论主线互补，属人文侧面，不承担理论解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../on-ten-major-relationships/\">论十大关系</a></td>\n<td>该篇讲话逐条解读</td>\n<td>本库建设探索章只概述其&quot;以苏为鉴&quot;地位；十对关系逐条分析在该库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../on-correctly-handling-contradictions/\">关于正确处理人民内部矛盾的问题</a></td>\n<td>该篇原著精读</td>\n<td>本库只讲两类矛盾学说的理论突破；命题展开在该库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../mao-military-thought/\">毛泽东军事思想</a></td>\n<td>军事专题纵深研究</td>\n<td>本库军事章是体系中的一章（约一篇篇幅）；军事专门研究在该库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../mao-party-building-thought/\">毛泽东党建思想</a></td>\n<td>党建专题纵深研究</td>\n<td>同上分工——本库党建章是骨架，专题深化在该库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话判断：<strong>想建立理论全景、备考应试、理解概念之间的关系——读本库；想精读某篇原著、深挖某个专题——直接去对应兄弟库。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>路径一 · 应试速通（考研政治／课程期末）</strong>：按考纲板块走最短路线——</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"theoretical-formation/living-soul-three-principles\">活的灵魂：实事求是、群众路线、独立自主</a>（选择题高频：三者关系与哲学定位）</li>\n<li><a href=\"revolution-military-theory/new-democratic-revolution-theory\">新民主主义革命理论基础</a>（分析题主力：三大对象、四大动力、两步走）</li>\n<li><a href=\"party-building-construction/party-building-principles\">马克思主义政党建设原则</a>（思想建党、三大作风）</li>\n<li><a href=\"historical-position-value/first-historic-leap\">马克思主义中国化的第一次历史性飞跃</a>（总括性收束，直接对应&quot;毛概&quot;结论章）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>路径二 · 系统通读（研究者／深度学习者）</strong>：严格按章序 1→2→3→4、每章内按文档编号顺序读。第一章是全库的&quot;总钥匙&quot;——<a href=\"theoretical-formation/thought-formation-development\">科学体系的形成发展与历史背景</a> 给出时间线，<a href=\"theoretical-formation/marxism-localization-china\">马列主义中国化的理论创新</a> 给出方法论主线，后面三章都是这条主线的分领域展开。</p>\n<p><strong>路径三 · 方法论应用（管理者／对&quot;活学活用&quot;感兴趣者）</strong>：跳过史实细节，直取可迁移的思维工具——</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"theoretical-formation/living-soul-three-principles\">活的灵魂：实事求是、群众路线、独立自主</a>（调查研究和&quot;从群众中来、到群众中去&quot;的工作方法）</li>\n<li><a href=\"revolution-military-theory/military-strategy-peoples-war\">军事战略与战术：从游击战到人民战争</a>（弱势方&quot;集中优势兵力&quot;的不对称竞争逻辑）</li>\n<li><a href=\"party-building-construction/socialist-construction-exploration\">社会主义建设探索</a>（《论十大关系》的统筹兼顾与&quot;两类矛盾&quot;的分析框架）</li>\n<li><a href=\"historical-position-value/contemporary-guiding-significance\">对当代中国发展的指导意义</a>（这些方法在当代决策中的转化形态）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>路径四 · 军事兴趣切入</strong>：先读 <a href=\"theoretical-formation/thought-formation-development\">科学体系的形成发展与历史背景</a> 的井冈山与延安两节建立史实底座，再读 <a href=\"revolution-military-theory/military-strategy-peoples-war\">军事战略与战术：从游击战到人民战争</a> 全篇；之后转入兄弟库 <a href=\"../on-protracted-war/\">《论持久战》精读</a> 与 <a href=\"../mao-military-thought/\">毛泽东军事思想</a> 做专题纵深。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>中国近代史时间轴（必需）</strong>：至少能按序说出 1840 鸦片战争、1919 五四运动、1921 建党、1927 大革命失败、1935 遵义会议、1945 中共七大、1949 建国。本库各篇默认读者已知这些节点的先后关系，不再重复交代。</li>\n<li><strong>马克思主义哲学最低限度（建议）</strong>：对立统一规律、实践与认识的关系、人民群众的历史作用三个概念。缺这一层，第一章《实践论》《矛盾论》相关段落与第三章&quot;两类矛盾&quot;的理解成本会明显升高；具备这一层，全库可顺畅通读。</li>\n<li><strong>不需要</strong>：无需任何外文文献基础，也无需事先通读过毛选原著——本库所有著作引用均交代了写作年份与问题语境，可直接进入。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"theoretical-formation","title":"理论体系与形成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought/theoretical-formation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"thought-formation-development","title":"科学体系的形成发展与历史背景","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought/theoretical-formation/thought-formation-development"},{"seq":2,"slug":"living-soul-three-principles","title":"活的灵魂：实事求是、群众路线、独立自主","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought/theoretical-formation/living-soul-three-principles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"marxism-localization-china","title":"马列主义中国化的理论创新","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought/theoretical-formation/marxism-localization-china"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"revolution-military-theory","title":"革命与军事理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought/revolution-military-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"new-democratic-revolution-theory","title":"新民主主义革命理论基础","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought/revolution-military-theory/new-democratic-revolution-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"military-strategy-peoples-war","title":"军事战略与战术：从游击战到人民战争","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought/revolution-military-theory/military-strategy-peoples-war"},{"seq":3,"slug":"united-front-theory-practice","title":"统一战线理论与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought/revolution-military-theory/united-front-theory-practice"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"party-building-construction","title":"党建与社会主义建设","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought/party-building-construction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"party-building-principles","title":"马克思主义政党建设原则","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought/party-building-construction/party-building-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"socialist-construction-exploration","title":"社会主义建设探索","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought/party-building-construction/socialist-construction-exploration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"historical-position-value","title":"历史地位与当代价值","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought/historical-position-value","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"first-historic-leap","title":"马克思主义中国化的第一次历史性飞跃","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought/historical-position-value/first-historic-leap"},{"seq":2,"slug":"contemporary-guiding-significance","title":"对当代中国发展的指导意义","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought/historical-position-value/contemporary-guiding-significance"}]}]}